msgid "@niko3 ...hey."
msgstr "@niko3 ...엇."

msgid "@niko2 \\p... did you see that?"
msgstr "@niko2 \\p 님...저거 보셨어요?"

msgid "@niko4 The squares just..."
msgstr "@niko4 사각형이..."

msgid "@niko3 It just happened again..."
msgstr "@niko3 또 이런 일이..."

msgid "@niko2 I...\\.\\. think...\\>\\n\\@niko6 Something is making them go away!"
msgstr "@niko2 제...\\.\\. 생각에는...\\>\\n\\@niko6 무언가가 사각형을 사라지게 하는 것 같아요!"

msgid "@niko2 ...come on, let's try the rest."
msgstr "@niko2 ...어서, 나머지도 해 봐요."

msgid "@niko_speak It's another artifact, \\p!"
msgstr "@niko_speak 또 다른 유물이에요, \\p 님!"

msgid "@niko5 I don't really know what they're supposed to do, but...\\> \\@niko_83c it's fun just looking around for them!"
msgstr "@niko5 무슨 용도인지는 모르겠지만...\\> \\@niko_83c 그냥 찾아다니는 것만으로도 재미있어요!"

msgid "@niko6 It's another one of those glowy things..."
msgstr "@niko6 또 다른 빛나는 것이에요..."

msgid "$If you are reading this, it means you were able to collect your first artifact successfully."
msgstr "$이걸 읽고 있다면, 첫 번째 유물을 무사히 손에 넣었다는 뜻이겠죠."

msgid "$Good work."
msgstr "$잘했습니다."

msgid "$Now that you know what to do, keep in mind that some artifacts may be in locations that will be out of Niko's reach."
msgstr "$이제 뭘 해야 할지 알겠죠? 어떤 유물은 니코의 손으로 주울 수 없답니다."

msgid "$Do not worry, you will still be able to collect them."
msgstr "$하지만 걱정 마세요. 당신이 주우면 되니까요."

msgid "$And with that, I wish you luck."
msgstr "$그럼 행운을 빌어드리죠."

msgid "$Happy hunting."
msgstr "$유물을 잘 찾아보세요."

msgid "@niko \"Artifacts\", huh..."
msgstr "@niko \"유물\"이라..."

msgid "@niko_pancakes Ooh! Sounds like some kind of treasure hunt! \\>\\n\\@niko_83c Like that one time my friends and I spent a whole day looking for cool rocks."
msgstr "@niko_pancakes 우와! 무슨 보물찾기 같네요! \\>\\n\\@niko_83c 제 친구와 함께 온종일 멋진 돌멩이를 찾아다녔던 때가 생각나요."

msgid "@niko2 ...?"
msgstr "@niko2 ...?"

msgid "@niko2 \\p? Do you see this... weird glowy thing floating here?"
msgstr "@niko2 \\p 님? 여기 떠 있는 이... 이상하고 빛나는 거 보이세요?"

msgid "@niko I wanted to pick it up, but... \\>\\@niko_eyeclosed my hand just went right through the whole thing!"
msgstr "@niko 줍고 싶은데... \\>\\@niko_eyeclosed 제 손은 그냥 통과해 버렸어요!"

msgid "@niko_pancakes Oh! Maybe it's like, a hologram!\\>\\n\\@niko_83c I've seen that in a cartoon once."
msgstr "@niko_pancakes 아! 홀로그램 같은 걸까요?\\>\\n\\@niko_83c 전에 만화책에서 본 적이 있어요."

msgid "@niko_speak ...wait, there's a note on it!"
msgstr "@niko_speak ...어라, 저기 쪽지가 붙어 있어요!"

msgid "$Occasionally, you may find special artifacts such as these scattered throughout this world."
msgstr "$이 물건처럼 세상 곳곳에 흩어진 특별한 유물을 종종 발견할 수 있습니다."

msgid "$As these artifacts do not physically exist in this world, Niko will be unable to make use of them."
msgstr "$이런 유물은 이 세상에 실재하는 것이 아니라, 니코는 만질 수가 없죠."

msgid "$However, your powers extend beyond Niko's, so why don't you try picking it up?"
msgstr "$하지만, 당신의 힘은 니코의 힘을 능가하니 한번 주워보는 게 어떨까요?"

